侯胜一向正直，就对他说：“先生请提出正言，不要因从前的事而有所顾忌！” 夏侯胜又担任长信少府，后来迁任太子太傅。夏侯胜年九十去世，太后赐钱二百万，为他穿素服五天，以报答师傅之恩。儒者以此为荣。","content_jianti_auto":"胜为人，质朴守正，简易无威仪，或时谓上为君，误相字于前；上亦以是亲信之。尝见，出道上语，上闻而让胜，胜曰：「陛下所言善，臣故扬之。尧言布于天下，至今见诵。臣以为可传，故传耳。」朝廷每有大议，上知胜素直，谓曰：「先生建正言，无惩前事！」胜复为长信少府，后迁太子太傅。年九十卒，太后赐钱二百万，为胜素服五日，以报师傅之恩。儒者以为荣。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1988,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"90be4636-db0e-11ef-98ba-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"安丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"安丘","place_note":"山東安丘","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"90be464b-db0e-11ef-8325-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淳于","place_name_jianti_auto":"淳于","place_note":"山東安丘東北","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"90be464c-db0e-11ef-9d18-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北海郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"北海郡","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"90be464d-db0e-11ef-a2c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"安丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"安丘","place_note":"山東安丘","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"90be464e-db0e-11ef-988d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"90be464f-db0e-11ef-b619-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渠丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"渠丘","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"90be4650-db0e-11ef-b80f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"淳于","place_name_jianti_auto":"淳于","place_note":"山東安丘東北","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"90be4651-db0e-11ef-aa47-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"春秋","place_name_jianti_auto":"春秋","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"90be4652-db0e-11ef-bfc1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"安丘、淳于二縣皆屬北海郡。安丘，春秋時之渠丘。淳于，春秋之州國。","note_content_jianti_auto":"安丘、淳于二县皆属北海郡。安丘，春秋时之渠丘。淳于，春秋之州国。","note_type":"hu_note","start_ind